   * M6 fraud analyst. Deliberately a PEER of SENIOR_REVIEWER rather than its
   * senior: an analyst may work every fraud case but may not confirm a
   * sanctions-derived one or add a permanent blocklist entry, which is
   * `SENIOR_REVIEWER`/`ADMIN` territory. Declared after SENIOR_REVIEWER because
   * Postgres sorts an enum by declaration order and the console orders queues by
   * role seniority.
   */
  ANALYST
